{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--escaping-containers-to-host","name":"escaping-containers-to-host","description":"Exploits privileged pods, host mounts, runC CVEs, and exposed Docker sockets to break out of a container and reach the underlying host during an authorized container-security assessment. Use when executing an approved breakout test, demonstrating the real impact of a privileged or hostPath workload, or validating that escape mitigations actually hold. Keywords: container breakout, privileged, hostPath, docker.sock, runC CVE-2019-5736, CVE-2024-21626, release_agent, nsenter. Do not use for defensive detection of these techniques - use detecting-container-escape-attempts.","category":"Security","tags":["escaping","containers","host","exploits","privileged","pods","mounts","runc","cves","exposed","docker","sockets","break","out","container","reach","underlying","during"],"repo":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","owner":"mukul975","stars":34277,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","licensePath":"skills/escaping-containers-to-host/LICENSE","revision":"54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57","path":"skills/escaping-containers-to-host","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/tree/54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57/skills/escaping-containers-to-host","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:14:06.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T04:32:42Z","fileCount":5,"bytes":36566,"sha256":"a19ce2a1725033274a5d7cd3defa2d8f0ac1ba706c1968720debef073c50ff62","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"LICENSE","sourcePath":"skills/escaping-containers-to-host/LICENSE","bytes":11255,"sha256":"a941b58ef0ba43a31e24ae7ece1b743a585efed9e37792b9ca063e0798be1cbe","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57/skills/escaping-containers-to-host/LICENSE"},{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/escaping-containers-to-